universal-downloader (2.0.2) stable; urgency=medium

  * Added the Universal Downloader 2.0.2 graphical desktop application
    (PyQt6/Qt6): link paste, automatic source detection with manual
    override, persistent download queue, real progress, speed and ETA,
    pause/resume/cancel/retry, download history, settings and logs.
  * Backend adapters for YouTube (yt-dlp), Google Drive (gdown), MEGA
    (MEGAcmd) and direct file links (aria2c) with resume, skip-complete
    and verified completion.
  * Debian package installing under /opt/universal-downloader with an
    application menu entry; user data kept in the home directory and
    preserved across uninstall.

 -- Universal Downloader <packaging@universal-downloader.local>  Wed, 05 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000
